<title>GERMANY: German Sept steel output falls 11.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German Sept steel output falls 11.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office gave the following data on pan-German steel production ( in millions of tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Sept	Pct change</p>
<p> Pig iron	 2.31	  -11.6</p>
<p> Crude steel    3.38	   -8.3</p>
<p>		  Jan-Sept    Pct Change</p>
<p> Pig iron	20.34	  -11.4</p>
<p> Crude steel   29.22	   -9.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage changes are against year-earlier figures.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
